'''Blossom''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it for 75 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}} during the [[Valentines Event 2016|2016 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is light pastel pink with a small rose imprinted on the heel. The guard is a shiny silver, and the handle is solid black.  

== Trivia ==
*Blossom is the fifth of the six knives included in the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Valentine Set|Valentine Set]], the others being [[Roses]], [[Valentine]], [[Passion]], [[Hearts]] and [[Sweetheart]].  

